 2014 A:d42a                                    ; THIS IS THE LINE INPUT ROUTINE.
 2015 A:d42a                                    ; IT READS CHARACTERS INTO BUF USING BACKARROW (UNDERSCORE, OR
 2016 A:d42a                                    ; SHIFT O) AS THE DELETE CHARACTER AND @ AS THE 
 2017 A:d42a                                    ; LINE DELETE CHARACTER. IF MORE THAN BUFLEN CHARACTERS
 2018 A:d42a                                    ; ARE TYPED, NO ECHOING IS DONE UNTIL A BACKARROW OR @ OR CR
 2019 A:d42a                                    ; IS TYPED. CONTROL-G WILL BE TYPED FOR EACH EXTRA CHARACTER.
 2020 A:d42a                                    ; THE ROUTINE IS ENTERED AT INLIN.
 2021 A:d42a                                    ;

 2024 A:d42a                           INLIN     
 2024 A:d42a  a2 80                              ldx #128
 2025 A:d42c  86 33                              stx 51
 2026 A:d42e  20 67 fd                           jsr 64871
 2027 A:d431  e0 ef                              cpx #240-1
 2028 A:d433  b0 02                              bcs GDBUFS
 2029 A:d435  a2 ef                              ldx #240-1
 2030 A:d437                           GDBUFS    
 2030 A:d437  a9 00                              lda #0
 2031 A:d439  9d 00 02                           sta 512,X
 2032 A:d43c  8a                                 txa 
 2033 A:d43d  f0 0b                              beq NOCHR
