 2476 A:d5f0                           RESRCH    
 2476 A:d5f0  ca                                 dex                    ;IS THIS THE RES'D WORD?
 2477 A:d5f1  f0 0a                              beq PRIT3                ;YES, GO TOSS IT UP..
 2478 A:d5f3                           RESCR1    
