 2997 A:d823                                    ;SINCE WHEN "GOSUB" STUCK THE TEXT  PNTR
 2998 A:d823                                    ;ONTO THE STACK, THE LINE NUMBER ARG
 2999 A:d823                                    ;HADN'T BEEN READ YET.
 3000 A:d823                           ADDON     
