 5254 A:e2c0                                    ;
 5255 A:e2c0                                    ; SOME STRING FUNCTION IS RETURNING A RESULT IN DSCTMP.
 5256 A:e2c0                                    ; SETUP A TEMP DESCRIPTOR WITH DSCTMP IN IT.
 5257 A:e2c0                                    ; PUT A POINTER TO THE DESCRIPTOR IN FACMO&LO AND FLAG THE
