 5572 A:e49e                                    ;
 5573 A:e49e                                    ; "FRETMP" IS PASSED A STRING DESCRIPTOR PNTR IN [Y,A].
 5574 A:e49e                                    ; A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE STRING DESCRIPTOR POINTS TO THE LAST
 5575 A:e49e                                    ; TEMPORARY DESCRIPTOR ALLOCATED BY PUTNEW.
 5576 A:e49e                                    ; IF SO, THE TEMPORARY IS FREED UP BY THE UPDATING OF [TEMPPT].
 5577 A:e49e                                    ; IF A TEMP IS FREED UP, A FURTHER CHECK SEES IF THE STRING DATA THAT
 5578 A:e49e                                    ; THAT STRING TEMP PNT'D TO IS THE LOWEST PART OF STRING SPACE IN USE.
 5579 A:e49e                                    ; IF SO, [FRETOP] IS UPDATED TO REFLECT THE FACT THE FACT THAT THE SPACE
 5580 A:e49e                                    ; IS NO LONGER IN USE.
 5581 A:e49e                                    ; THE ADDR OF THE ACTUAL STRING IS RETURNED IN [Y,X] AND
 5582 A:e49e                                    ; ITS LENGTH IN ACCA.
 5583 A:e49e                                    ;
 5584 A:e49e                           FRESTR    
 5584 A:e49e  20 16 dc                           jsr CHKSTR                ;MAKE SURE ITS A STRING.
 5585 A:e4a1                           FREFAC    
 5585 A:e4a1                                    ;FREE UP STR PNT'D TO BY FAC.
 5586 A:e4a1  a5 a3                              lda FACMO
 5587 A:e4a3  a4 a4                              ldy FACMO+1
 5588 A:e4a5                           FRETMP    
 5588 A:e4a5                                    ;GET LENGTH FOR LATER.
 5589 A:e4a5  85 61                              sta INDEX1
 5590 A:e4a7  84 62                              sty INDEX1+1
