 5764 A:e5a8                                    ;
 5765 A:e5a8                                    ; THE "VAL" FUNCTION TAKES A STRING AND TURNS IT INTO
 5766 A:e5a8                                    ; A NUMBER BY INTERPRETING THE ASCII DIGITS ETCQ
 5767 A:e5a8                                    ; EXCEPT FOR THE PROBLEM THAT A TERMINATOR MUST BE SUPPLIED
